  "description": "An example plugin to read, copy and change: twenty animated backdrops behind the chat in the Claude desktop app, with frosted-glass panels, one per project or per session. Needs a version of Claude Desktop that draws a plugin's backdrop.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 hook**, `hooks.json`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install theme-examples@claude-plugins-official` from `anthropics/claude-plugins-official` (`plugins/theme-examples`).\n\nTwenty scenes to paint behind your Claude Code desktop window, light and dark.\n\nAn example plugin to read, copy and change: twenty animated backdrops behind the chat in the Claude desktop app, with frosted-glass panels, one per project or per session. Needs a version of Claude Desktop that draws a plugin's backdrop.",
